<title>SPAIN: Telefonica's sec gen named Antena 3 TV chairman.</title>
<headline>Telefonica's sec gen named Antena 3 TV chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Antena 3 television station said it had appointed Telefonica secretary general Jose Mas Millet as its new chairman on Monday.</p>
<p>Telefonica effectively assumed control of the private television channel with the appointment, in defiance of the European Commission.</p>
<p>The Commission warned the Spanish telecoms operator last week to get EU approval before going ahead with its purchase of Antena 3.</p>
</text>
